🧾 Input Structure (HackerRank Style)
Q  (number of queries)

Commands:
CREATE_TOPIC <topic_name>
CREATE_PRODUCER <producer_name>
CREATE_CONSUMER <consumer_name>
PUBLISH <producer_name> <topic_name> <message_id> <payload>
CONSUME <consumer_name> <topic_name>

📥 Sample Input
    10
    CREATE_TOPIC orders
    CREATE_PRODUCER p1
    CREATE_CONSUMER c1
    PUBLISH p1 orders 1 orderA
    PUBLISH p1 orders 2 orderB
    CONSUME c1 orders
    CONSUME c1 orders
    CONSUME c1 orders
    CREATE_CONSUMER c2
    CONSUME c2 orders

📤 Sample Output
    Topic created: orders
    Producer created: p1
    Consumer created: c1
    p1 published to orders: orderA
    p1 published to orders: orderB
    c1 consumed from orders: orderA
    c1 consumed from orders: orderB
    c1 no new messages in orders
    Consumer created: c2
    c2 consumed from orders: orderA